        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 <strong>A New Experience in Sci-Fi Action Roguelike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867650/extras/95efc24cc14a43f5383e080fabfdc296.poster.avif?t=1782222371\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867650/extras/95efc24cc14a43f5383e080fabfdc296.webm?t=1782222371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867650/extras/95efc24cc14a43f5383e080fabfdc296.mp4?t=1782222371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Retroid: Cartridge Protocol</i> combines <strong>fast-paced combat, unpredictable enemies, and the thrill of progression</strong> into a high-quality sci-fi roguelike experience. Every run offers new battles and strategic choices, keeping the challenge fresh and immersive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📘 <strong>Lore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867650/extras/b0b3de0ac41b2cdfa19a19a256eebbcb.poster.avif?t=1782222371\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867650/extras/b0b3de0ac41b2cdfa19a19a256eebbcb.webm?t=1782222371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867650/extras/b0b3de0ac41b2cdfa19a19a256eebbcb.mp4?t=1782222371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once overshadowed, Dr. Victor stole Dr. Evelyn’s groundbreaking technology out of envy, creating the Overmind army to seize control of the planet. As Prototype Zero-One, you are the only one who can unlock the hidden power within the cartridges and reclaim the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable battles</strong> – Enemy evolutions create new combat patterns every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple yet deep controls</strong> – Outsmart foes and map traps with melee strikes and precise dashes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress through exploration</strong> – Permanent and temporary upgrades fuel long-term growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed sci-fi design</strong> – Immerse yourself in a richly crafted futuristic world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867650/extras/3ec6d6c9bd40b6b929197a8fd7fbd1fc.poster.avif?t=1782222371\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867650/extras/3ec6d6c9bd40b6b929197a8fd7fbd1fc.webm?t=1782222371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867650/extras/3ec6d6c9bd40b6b929197a8fd7fbd1fc.mp4?t=1782222371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find every cartridge. Unlock your final evolution.  </strong><br> <br> <br><strong>Take back the planet from the Overmind army.</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 <strong>A New Experience in Sci-Fi Action Roguelike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867650/extras/95efc24cc14a43f5383e080fabfdc296.poster.avif?t=1782222371\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867650/extras/95efc24cc14a43f5383e080fabfdc296.webm?t=1782222371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867650/extras/95efc24cc14a43f5383e080fabfdc296.mp4?t=1782222371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Retroid: Cartridge Protocol</i> combines <strong>fast-paced combat, unpredictable enemies, and the thrill of progression</strong> into a high-quality sci-fi roguelike experience. Every run offers new battles and strategic choices, keeping the challenge fresh and immersive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📘 <strong>Lore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867650/extras/b0b3de0ac41b2cdfa19a19a256eebbcb.poster.avif?t=1782222371\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867650/extras/b0b3de0ac41b2cdfa19a19a256eebbcb.webm?t=1782222371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867650/extras/b0b3de0ac41b2cdfa19a19a256eebbcb.mp4?t=1782222371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once overshadowed, Dr. Victor stole Dr. Evelyn’s groundbreaking technology out of envy, creating the Overmind army to seize control of the planet. As Prototype Zero-One, you are the only one who can unlock the hidden power within the cartridges and reclaim the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable battles</strong> – Enemy evolutions create new combat patterns every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple yet deep controls</strong> – Outsmart foes and map traps with melee strikes and precise dashes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress through exploration</strong> – Permanent and temporary upgrades fuel long-term growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed sci-fi design</strong> – Immerse yourself in a richly crafted futuristic world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867650/extras/3ec6d6c9bd40b6b929197a8fd7fbd1fc.poster.avif?t=1782222371\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867650/extras/3ec6d6c9bd40b6b929197a8fd7fbd1fc.webm?t=1782222371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867650/extras/3ec6d6c9bd40b6b929197a8fd7fbd1fc.mp4?t=1782222371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find every cartridge. Unlock your final evolution.  </strong><br> <br> <br><strong>Take back the planet from the Overmind army.</strong></p>",
